arded as pretentious, sometimes adopts wrong tone (communication/cooperation). So strong reliability and stress, but communication issues.\n\nC: can make correct decisions quickly (decision quality), difficulty communicating ideas (cooperation), regarded as egocentric (cooperation), not willing to further education (adaptability), puts concern for others above everything (good teamwork), excellent attention skills (attention). Mixed: decision quality, attention, but poor communication and egocentric.\n\nD: responds to unexpected events adequately (stress resilience), can concentrate very well (attention), solves problems extremely well (technical), takes responsibility seriously (responsibility), but considered moody, regarded as loner (cooperation). So strong technical, responsibility, but cooperation issues.\n\nWe need to pick best overall fit. Likely B has strong reliability and stress, but communication issues may be mitigated? A has leadership but unfriendly. D has problem solving but moody. C has decision quality but egocentric.\n\nProbably B is strongest overall, as reliability and stress are critical, and communication issues are less severe than egocentric or moody? But B's pretentiousness and wrong tone could affect crew cooperation. However, B's conscientiousness and stress handling are vital for long-distance.\n\nWe need to argue for B, referencing facts: very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, but note communication concerns. Conclude B still best.\n\nLet's produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE stating recommendation for Candidate B, referencing those facts, and acknowledging concerns but weighing them.\n\nWe also need METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nProceed."}
