re, and makes correct decisions quickly, which may outweigh his communication difficulty. However C's egocentric and unwillingness to further education are concerns. Which is stronger? Might still favor B.\n\nWe can say we agree with Agent 3's recommendation for B, but we need to address the cooperation concerns. Provide evidence: B can be grumpy and uncooperative. C creates positive atmosphere. But C's egocentric and not willing to further education may affect adaptability. So B remains best.\n\nThus we will state we still recommend B, acknowledging concerns but weighing them.\n\nWe must include metadata vote B.\n\nProceed."}
